        "contentStatus": "available",
        "content": {
          "format": "source-lines",
          "lines": [
            "1 Zipna zaengsw tho de, he zianmeile,",
            "Kaipouc ngaengv khou nang py mbanlouna;",
            "Aniw zian e, Jisu @{4 zian diangc e;",
            "Mang gay, mang gay tho de!",
            "",
            "2 Nang ramzip hei zip theic mangh mang bu the,",
            "Kap khang, taanh khang nang thu thau dat lak khe;",
            "Nang ramzip hei zaengsw suangmei kiu e;",
            "Mang gay, mang gay tho de!",
            "",
            "3 Zinghmei swng kandih khou @{4 ’maan mak saanv,",
            "Kadaeng khou khuam kariu guanglou mak saanv,",
            "Zinghmei, ryanramei guay hei kuak mak saanv,",
            "Mang gay, mang gay tho de!",
            "",
            "4 Estar hym @{4 tingpuk guay gaanh mak saanv,",
            "Jisu khou theihmei nunc ringcthau mak saanv,",
            "Kamei hym daicna key datmakpui saanv,",
            "Mang gay, mang gay tho de!",
            "",
            "5 ’Tamv suang khang hamh, “Mang gay tho” tw tuang de,",
            "Asaanh makna ’thanmei guay kariu ni;",
            "Phak dat lakmei ’thanmei phwam sw puni;",
            "Mang gay, mang gay tho de!",
            "",
            "6 Kabamvpaeng hu khou sow ariw mak saanv,",
            "Kamei nunc khou ’thanmei pwan tii mak saanv,",
            "’Niu thaymei kumc khat khat ta thay mak saanv,",
            "Mang gay, mang gay tho de!"
          ]
        }
      },
